---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ImageSage Support — Photo Search & Setup Troubleshooting"
  description="Get help with ImageSage photo search, folder access, OCR preparation and Magic Rename. Check Windows requirements and contact support without sharing private images."
  current="support.html"
>
  <main id="content" class="document">
    <p class="doc-eyebrow">Help</p>
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="lead">ImageSage supports Windows 10 version 22H2 (build 19045) and Windows 11 on x64 devices, plus local PNG, JPEG, and WebP files.</p>

    <section class="contact-card" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div>
        <h2 id="contact-title">Contact ImageSage support</h2>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@ringlochid.me">support@ringlochid.me</a>. Include the ImageSage version, Windows version, what you did, and the visible error message.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:support@ringlochid.me?subject=ImageSage%20support">Compose support email</a>
    </section>

    <h2>Before reporting a problem</h2>
    <p>New to ImageSage? Start with the <a href={url('guides.html')}>photo search and rename guides</a> for search examples and step-by-step instructions.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Confirm that the folder still exists and your Windows account can read it.</li>
      <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong> and use <strong>Import again</strong> for an unavailable folder source.</li>
      <li>Allow preparation to finish before judging OCR or visual-search completeness.</li>
      <li>Install the latest ImageSage update from Microsoft Store and restart the app.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Protect your private content</h2>
    <div class="callout">
      <p>Do not attach original photos, recognized text, private filenames or paths, databases, credentials, or secrets. ImageSage does not automatically attach diagnostics or library content to an email.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Report an AI-generated suggestion</h2>
    <p>Magic Rename suggestions can be inaccurate or inappropriate. Nothing changes until you confirm a name. Report only the generated words, the ImageSage version, and a general non-identifying description of the image category.</p>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:support@ringlochid.me?subject=ImageSage%20AI%20suggestion%20report">Compose AI suggestion report <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
